      "answer": "Project Atlas uses Beacon Evidence Hub as its evidence organization tool. [S3]\n\nDecision DEC-001 approved the selection of Beacon Evidence Hub for Project Atlas on October 12, 2026. [S3]\n\nThe Compliance Office is the operational owner of Beacon Evidence Hub. [S4]\n\nProject charters identify which projects use these tools, and a decision approver is a distinct role from a tool owner. [S4]\n\nThe Compliance Office approved the selection of Beacon Evidence Hub for Project Atlas. [S3]",
