        "text": "## Reason for selection\n\nBeacon Evidence Hub was selected to organize evidence records and their review ownership in one place. LedgerCheck remains the team's tool for checking evidence completeness. Selecting Beacon Evidence Hub does not replace LedgerCheck's completeness checks.\n\n",
