        "score": 0.659937918,
        "text": "## Decision and project\n\nDecision DEC-001 selects Beacon Evidence Hub as the evidence organization tool for Project Atlas. The decision was approved on October 12, 2026. It concerns internal compliance operations, not investment selection or expected returns.\n\n",
