        "id": "f1106f8d020c2cb51de55b3f6001d65763f9a438d5423a53791ddc32c466b20e",
        "score": 0.603142202,
        "text": "## Tool responsibilities\n\nBeacon Evidence Hub organizes compliance evidence records and their review ownership. Its operational owner is the Compliance Office.\n\nLedgerCheck checks whether required compliance evidence is complete. Priya Shah maintains its evidence-completeness rule catalogue. LedgerCheck does not organize the evidence repository itself.\n\nHarbor Access Register records access-request ownership and review outcomes. Its operational owner is the Data Platform team.\n\nSignal Lineage Board records internal risk-reporting dependencies and source lineage. Its operational owner is the Risk Analytics team.\n\nProject charters identify which projects use these tools. A tool owner, rule maintainer, project sponsor, and decision approver are different roles.\n\n",
